sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant API as Core API
    participant Storage as Blob Storage
    participant Queue as Parse Job Queue
    participant Worker as PDF Parser Worker
    participant DB as Timetable Database

    User->>Frontend: Submit timetable PDF
    Frontend->>API: Request timetable import
    API->>API: Validate source and create parse job
    API->>Storage: Store source PDF
    API->>Queue: Assign parse job
    API-->>Frontend: Return job reference

    Queue-->>Worker: Deliver assigned job
    Worker->>Storage: Read source PDF
    Worker->>Worker: Extract data with university adapter
    Worker->>API: Return normalized timetable and outcome
    API->>DB: Record timetable data and job status

    loop While import is running
        Frontend->>API: Check import status
        API-->>Frontend: Progress or completion
    end
    Frontend-->>User: Display imported timetable data
